<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Decor half year earnings fall, div held.</title>
<headline>Decor half year earnings fall, div held.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     7.95	  vs 9.93</p>
<p>    Shr, pr-except (cts)  7.95	  vs 9.16</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 2.50	  vs 2.50</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   1.63	  vs 1.78</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   2.35	  vs 1.80</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.73	  vs 0.01</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   0.43	  vs 0.22</p>
<p>    Exceptional gain	 -	    vs 0.14</p>
<p>    Turnover		 11.21	  vs 10.44</p>
<p>Div payable April 18</p>
<p>on register April 4</p>
<p>Full name: Decor Investment Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Stores group Decor said market conditions remained challenging but it expected a satisfactory level of profitability would be maintained.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
